SUMMARY:WINTER CAMP PRESENTS: KALEA MCNEILL
LOCATION:Mic Drop Comedy Chandler\, 51 E. Boston St.\, Chandler
DESCRIPTION:Kalea McNeill is an actor/standup comedian from the bay area. 
  She gained a love for performance at an early age through various plays\, 
 oratorical competitions\, and community events.  In 2009\, she graduated f
 rom Clark Atlanta University with a BA in Theatre Arts and moved to Los Ang
 eles shortly after to pursue her career.\n\nRecently\, she appeared in Comi
 c View on BET\, and FunnyAF with Kevin Hart on Netflix.  She was named a J
 ust For Laughs New Face of comedy in 2022\, has appeared on Don't Tell Come
 dy\, Comedy Central\, Netflix is a Joke Festival\, and the LMAOF Comedy Ser
 ies. She headlines around the country in addition to opening for legends su
 ch as George Wallace\, Earthquake\, and Arsenio Hall. Her Grammy considered
  debut comedy special\, Sma'am is currently streaming on Amazon Prime.\n\nA
 s an actor\, she is most known for her recurring character "Hanifa Downey" 
 on CW’s Crazy Ex Girlfriend\, but has also been seen on The Prank Panel o
 n ABC\, S.W.A.T. on CBS\, Baskets on FX\, Criminal Minds on Paramount +\, a
 nd Animal Kingdom on TNT.\n\nAges 18+\nFee applies if transferring confirme
 d ticket purchase to another guest.\nDoors for open for seating approximate
 ly 30 minutes before late showtimes. Please note\, doors are subject to pri
 or show endtime and may change without notice\, beyond our control.\nNo ref
 unds or exchanges.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/w
 inter-camp-presents-kalea-mcneill/
